          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">I want You to Come with Me</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œCatra, wait!â€ Adora called. â€œPlease?â€ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She stopped running, whirling around to face her. â€œWait for what, Princess Adora? For you to show me your new tiara up close and personal? No thanks.â€ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora slowed to a stop in front of Catra. She was breathing hard and barely able to stand up right. â€œDonâ€™t be ridiculous, Catra, I just wantâ€”â€ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œYour tiara is the only thing being ridiculous right now.â€ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;---&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or, the one where Adora chased after Catra at the end of episode 1x02 "The Sword part 2."&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
